1
00:00:00,047 --> 00:00:02,936
Kota suku Maya ditemukan
di hutan Meksiko...

2
00:00:02,936 --> 00:00:05,284
dan namanya "Tidak Ada Jalan"!

3
00:00:05,284 --> 00:00:06,878
Saking terpencilnya,

4
00:00:06,878 --> 00:00:09,767
arkeolog harus membabat hutan 5 kilometer.

5
00:00:09,767 --> 00:00:12,218
Nama aslinya baru saja terbaca:

6
00:00:12,218 --> 00:00:13,858
kemungkinan Sakil,

7
00:00:13,858 --> 00:00:15,172
dari kata "putih".

8
00:00:15,172 --> 00:00:16,803
Rajanya bernama...

9
00:00:16,803 --> 00:00:17,847
Kelelawar!

10
00:00:17,847 --> 00:00:20,746
Dan nama Sakil terukir di kota musuhnya:

11
00:00:20,746 --> 00:00:21,783
seorang tawanan,

12
00:00:21,783 --> 00:00:22,908
tangannya terikat.

13
00:00:22,908 --> 00:00:24,753
Siapa yang menang perang itu...

14
00:00:24,753 --> 00:00:26,002
belum ada yang tahu.

15
00:00:26,002 --> 00:00:26,878
Menurutmu,

16
00:00:26,878 --> 00:00:28,444
Sakil menang atau kalah?

17
00:00:28,444 --> 00:00:29,987
Tulis di komentar!
